   "fontSize": 17,
   "fontFamily": 3,
   "text": "Then it reaches the <node id=\"lb\" …/>▼load balancer, which …\n\n▼ anchor: the op fires when playback reaches this character\nbudget = time until the next anchor, clamped 150–2500 ms\nI1: no op starts before its anchor word has been heard",
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": "re99",
   "originalText": "Then it reaches the <node id=\"lb\" …/>▼load balancer, which …\n\n▼ anchor: the op fires when playback reaches this character\nbudget = time until the next anchor, clamped 150–2500 ms\nI1: no op starts before its anchor word has been heard",
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
