   "boundElements": [],
   "updated": 1760486400000,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "fontSize": 17,
   "fontFamily": 5,
   "text": "Who owns what (LLD §3.10)\n• Core, and everything in it → the orchestrator task alone (law 3)\n• paths of shared sources, the brief cache in memory → the orchestrator's SourceDesk\n• vault files, the event log, the SQLite index → the store actor alone\n• the audio unit and route → the device supervisor\n• each stroke's progress, the animation clock → the UI\nShared state is a channel, a watch (latest wins), atomics, or a Mutex held only to\nread or swap, never across an .await.",
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": "lkre133",
   "originalText": "Who owns what (LLD §3.10)\n• Core, and everything in it → the orchestrator task alone (law 3)\n• paths of shared sources, the brief cache in memory → the orchestrator's SourceDesk\n• vault files, the event log, the SQLite index → the store actor alone\n• the audio unit and route → the device supervisor\n• each stroke's progress, the animation clock → the UI\nShared state is a channel, a watch (latest wins), atomics, or a Mutex held only to\nread or swap, never across an .await.",
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
  {
   "id": "lkre135",
   "type": "rectangle",
   "x": 1720,
   "y": 4230,
   "width": 1620,
   "height": 250,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#868e96",
