   "fontSize": 16,
   "fontFamily": 5,
   "text": "Starts only on a hosted talker, open mic, nobody drawing, the voice active,\nand a cloned core that asks for exactly one Talk.\nConfirmed when the turn ends with exactly that request; cancelled by\nVoiceResumed, another request, leaving Listening, drawing, 1 s, > 1,024 held.\nWhile pending: nothing spoken, captioned or drawn (sim::check::speculation).",
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "originalText": "Starts only on a hosted talker, open mic, nobody drawing, the voice active,\nand a cloned core that asks for exactly one Talk.\nConfirmed when the turn ends with exactly that request; cancelled by\nVoiceResumed, another request, leaving Listening, drawing, 1 s, > 1,024 held.\nWhile pending: nothing spoken, captioned or drawn (sim::check::speculation).",
