   "text": "waiting: Nobody (a prefetch, quietly with the next request)\n· Calls (held research calls) · Talker (a report turn)\nits diagram, carried: ThisReply · NextRequest · OnUse\nfailed, cancelled by voice or let go: every held call answered",
   "textAlign": "left",
