   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "fontSize": 18,
   "fontFamily": 5,
   "text": "Both pipelines (D-107, I18): a source's words reach the talker only in a user turn, between the task-output marks, fence markers broken up;\nBoardAI's own notes name its parts by id; nothing in a brief, a digest or a page can approve a change (I9).\nChips (I15): a source chip opens only a line this session read; a Doc card names only a page, figure or table read (I17), never one past the end (D-273).\nBounds: a brief 64 KiB · a digest 64 KiB · 4 diagrams waiting to stage · a page read 4.5 s inside its source job's 5 s · 12 pages a model call, 4 calls.",
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": "lkre360",
   "originalText": "Both pipelines (D-107, I18): a source's words reach the talker only in a user turn, between the task-output marks, fence markers broken up;\nBoardAI's own notes name its parts by id; nothing in a brief, a digest or a page can approve a change (I9).\nChips (I15): a source chip opens only a line this session read; a Doc card names only a page, figure or table read (I17), never one past the end (D-273).\nBounds: a brief 64 KiB · a digest 64 KiB · 4 diagrams waiting to stage · a page read 4.5 s inside its source job's 5 s · 12 pages a model call, 4 calls.",
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
