   "fontSize": 17,
   "fontFamily": 5,
   "text": "How a source's words travel once inside (D-107, I18)\n• to the talker only in a user turn, between <task-output> marks, any fence or\n  system-reminder marker inside broken up\n• BoardAI's own notes around them through PlainText::note\n• in a system message (board summary, thread, notices) only as ids\n• a part's label only to the UI (breadcrumbs, DetailAnchor.display, D-290)\nI15 a source chip opens only a line read · I17 a Doc card names only what was read ·\nI9 nothing that enters can approve a change: only your yes to BoardAI's own question",
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": "lkre442",
   "originalText": "How a source's words travel once inside (D-107, I18)\n• to the talker only in a user turn, between <task-output> marks, any fence or\n  system-reminder marker inside broken up\n• BoardAI's own notes around them through PlainText::note\n• in a system message (board summary, thread, notices) only as ids\n• a part's label only to the UI (breadcrumbs, DetailAnchor.display, D-290)\nI15 a source chip opens only a line read · I17 a Doc card names only what was read ·\nI9 nothing that enters can approve a change: only your yes to BoardAI's own question",
